  "historyNote": "#6328, INTERIM, eff 8-24-96, EXPIRED: 12-22-96 New. #6468-B, eff 3-5-97; ss by #6739-B, eff 5-8-98; ss and moved by #8278, eff 2-4-05 (from Env-A 1410.02); ss by #9601, eff 11-25-09; ss by #12443, eff 1-5-18; ss by #13334, eff 2-3-22",
